{
  "_doc": "Broker B4 执行内 cookie jar 纯决策 golden 向量。语言无关唯一事实源：TS（server cookie-jar.smoke.ts）与 Dart（client broker_cookie_jar_test.dart）照同一向量双跑。规格见 ADR-009 §2.4：四重栅栏（仅 passthrough origin / 不覆盖注入 / 永不收割 / 执行即弃）+ RFC 6265 domain/path 匹配。六组：decideEphemeralWrite（写回栅栏 1）/ parseCookieDate（RFC 6265 §5.1.1 逐 token 日期算法）/ parseMaxAge（§5.2.2 delta-seconds）/ parseSetCookie（§5.2 属性解析，含 Secure/Max-Age/Expires）/ matchCookieForSend（发送方向，含 Secure⟹https 与过期判据）/ selectCookies（同名多 Path 并存、长 Path 优先、ephemeral 按名被 origin 压制）。P1-05/P1-06 于 2026-08-07 扩组。改动须人工 + 安全清单复核（红线 #1）。",
  "_time_note": "所有 nowMs / expiresAt 均为 ms epoch。基准 nowMs=1600000000000（2020-09-13T12:26:40Z）。缺省 nowMs 的旧例由 harness 补 0（不影响无 expiresAt 的向量）。",
  "_view": {
    "_doc": "A 组各例共享的 manifest 视图（credentials.scope ⊆ allow，校验器 C6 已保证）。",
    "allow": [
      "https://dean.xjtu.edu.cn/*",
      "https://ids.xjtu.edu.cn/*",
      "https://cdn.example.com/static/*",
      "https://a.pass.example/*"
    ],
    "credentials": { "sess": { "scope": ["https://ids.xjtu.edu.cn/*"], "type": "cookie" } }
  },
  "decideEphemeralWrite": [
    {
      "name": "accept_passthrough_exact",
      "input": {
        "opts": { "name": "client_id", "value": "abc123", "domain": "dean.xjtu.edu.cn" },
        "view": { "allow": ["https://dean.xjtu.edu.cn/*", "https://ids.xjtu.edu.cn/*", "https://cdn.example.com/static/*", "https://a.pass.example/*"], "credentials": { "sess": { "scope": ["https://ids.xjtu.edu.cn/*"], "type": "cookie" } } }
      },
      "expected": { "ok": true, "cookie": { "name": "client_id", "value": "abc123", "domain": "dean.xjtu.edu.cn", "path": "/" } }
    },
    {
      "name": "accept_leading_dot_normalized",
      "input": {
        "opts": { "name": "client_id", "value": "abc123", "domain": ".dean.xjtu.edu.cn" },
        "view": { "allow": ["https://dean.xjtu.edu.cn/*", "https://ids.xjtu.edu.cn/*", "https://cdn.example.com/static/*", "https://a.pass.example/*"], "credentials": { "sess": { "scope": ["https://ids.xjtu.edu.cn/*"], "type": "cookie" } } }
      },
      "expected": { "ok": true, "cookie": { "name": "client_id", "value": "abc123", "domain": "dean.xjtu.edu.cn", "path": "/" } }
    },
    {
      "name": "reject_credential_domain_exact",
      "input": {
        "opts": { "name": "x", "value": "v", "domain": "ids.xjtu.edu.cn" },
        "view": { "allow": ["https://dean.xjtu.edu.cn/*", "https://ids.xjtu.edu.cn/*", "https://cdn.example.com/static/*", "https://a.pass.example/*"], "credentials": { "sess": { "scope": ["https://ids.xjtu.edu.cn/*"], "type": "cookie" } } }
      },
      "expected": { "ok": false, "reason": "domain_is_credential" }
    },
    {
      "name": "reject_credential_domain_parent",
      "input": {
        "opts": { "name": "x", "value": "v", "domain": "xjtu.edu.cn" },
        "view": { "allow": ["https://dean.xjtu.edu.cn/*", "https://ids.xjtu.edu.cn/*", "https://cdn.example.com/static/*", "https://a.pass.example/*"], "credentials": { "sess": { "scope": ["https://ids.xjtu.edu.cn/*"], "type": "cookie" } } }
      },
      "expected": { "ok": false, "reason": "domain_is_credential" }
    },
    {
      "name": "reject_domain_not_in_allow",
      "input": {
        "opts": { "name": "x", "value": "v", "domain": "evil.example.com" },
        "view": { "allow": ["https://dean.xjtu.edu.cn/*", "https://ids.xjtu.edu.cn/*", "https://cdn.example.com/static/*", "https://a.pass.example/*"], "credentials": { "sess": { "scope": ["https://ids.xjtu.edu.cn/*"], "type": "cookie" } } }
      },
      "expected": { "ok": false, "reason": "domain_not_passthrough" }
    },
    {
      "name": "reject_subdomain_narrower_than_allow",
      "input": {
        "opts": { "name": "x", "value": "v", "domain": "sub.dean.xjtu.edu.cn" },
        "view": { "allow": ["https://dean.xjtu.edu.cn/*", "https://ids.xjtu.edu.cn/*", "https://cdn.example.com/static/*", "https://a.pass.example/*"], "credentials": { "sess": { "scope": ["https://ids.xjtu.edu.cn/*"], "type": "cookie" } } }
      },
      "expected": { "ok": false, "reason": "domain_not_passthrough" }
    },
    {
      "name": "accept_path_within_allow_path",
      "input": {
        "opts": { "name": "t", "value": "v", "domain": "cdn.example.com", "path": "/static/js" },
        "view": { "allow": ["https://dean.xjtu.edu.cn/*", "https://ids.xjtu.edu.cn/*", "https://cdn.example.com/static/*", "https://a.pass.example/*"], "credentials": { "sess": { "scope": ["https://ids.xjtu.edu.cn/*"], "type": "cookie" } } }
      },
      "expected": { "ok": true, "cookie": { "name": "t", "value": "v", "domain": "cdn.example.com", "path": "/static/js" } }
    },
    {
      "name": "reject_default_path_wider_than_allow_path",
      "input": {
        "opts": { "name": "t", "value": "v", "domain": "cdn.example.com" },
        "view": { "allow": ["https://dean.xjtu.edu.cn/*", "https://ids.xjtu.edu.cn/*", "https://cdn.example.com/static/*", "https://a.pass.example/*"], "credentials": { "sess": { "scope": ["https://ids.xjtu.edu.cn/*"], "type": "cookie" } } }
      },
      "expected": { "ok": false, "reason": "path_too_wide" }
    },
    {
      "name": "accept_parent_domain_passthrough",
      "input": {
        "opts": { "name": "t", "value": "v", "domain": "pass.example" },
        "view": { "allow": ["https://dean.xjtu.edu.cn/*", "https://ids.xjtu.edu.cn/*", "https://cdn.example.com/static/*", "https://a.pass.example/*"], "credentials": { "sess": { "scope": ["https://ids.xjtu.edu.cn/*"], "type": "cookie" } } }
      },
      "expected": { "ok": true, "cookie": { "name": "t", "value": "v", "domain": "pass.example", "path": "/" } }
    }
  ],
  "matchCookieForSend": [
    {
      "name": "send_exact_host_root_path",
      "input": { "cookie": { "domain": "dean.xjtu.edu.cn", "path": "/" }, "requestUrl": "https://dean.xjtu.edu.cn/api/x" },
      "expected": true
    },
    {
      "name": "send_parent_domain",
      "input": { "cookie": { "domain": "xjtu.edu.cn", "path": "/" }, "requestUrl": "https://dean.xjtu.edu.cn/" },
      "expected": true
    },
    {
      "name": "nosend_host_only_to_subdomain",
      "input": { "cookie": { "domain": "dean.xjtu.edu.cn", "path": "/", "hostOnly": true }, "requestUrl": "https://sub.dean.xjtu.edu.cn/" },
      "expected": false
    },
    {
      "name": "send_explicit_domain_to_subdomain",
      "input": { "cookie": { "domain": "dean.xjtu.edu.cn", "path": "/", "hostOnly": false }, "requestUrl": "https://sub.dean.xjtu.edu.cn/" },
      "expected": true
    },
    {
      "name": "nosend_host_mismatch",
      "input": { "cookie": { "domain": "dean.xjtu.edu.cn", "path": "/" }, "requestUrl": "https://evil.com/" },
      "expected": false
    },
    {
      "name": "nosend_direction_reversed",
      "input": { "cookie": { "domain": "sub.dean.xjtu.edu.cn", "path": "/" }, "requestUrl": "https://dean.xjtu.edu.cn/" },
      "expected": false
    },
    {
      "name": "send_path_prefix_with_trailing_slash",
      "input": { "cookie": { "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/app/" }, "requestUrl": "https://h.edu/app/page" },
      "expected": true
    },
    {
      "name": "nosend_cookie_path_deeper",
      "input": { "cookie": { "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/app/admin" }, "requestUrl": "https://h.edu/app/" },
      "expected": false
    },
    {
      "name": "send_path_exact_no_trailing_slash",
      "input": { "cookie": { "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/app" }, "requestUrl": "https://h.edu/app" },
      "expected": true
    },
    {
      "name": "nosend_path_false_prefix",
      "input": { "cookie": { "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/app" }, "requestUrl": "https://h.edu/application" },
      "expected": false
    },

    {
      "name": "secure_sent_over_https",
      "input": { "cookie": { "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "secure": true }, "requestUrl": "https://h.edu/x", "nowMs": 1600000000000 },
      "expected": true
    },
    {
      "name": "secure_not_sent_over_http",
      "input": { "cookie": { "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "secure": true }, "requestUrl": "http://h.edu/x", "nowMs": 1600000000000 },
      "expected": false
    },
    {
      "name": "nonsecure_sent_over_http",
      "input": { "cookie": { "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "secure": false }, "requestUrl": "http://h.edu/x", "nowMs": 1600000000000 },
      "expected": true
    },
    {
      "name": "secure_not_sent_over_http_localhost_no_exemption",
      "input": { "cookie": { "domain": "localhost", "path": "/", "secure": true }, "requestUrl": "http://localhost/x", "nowMs": 1600000000000 },
      "expected": false
    },
    {
      "name": "expired_not_sent",
      "input": { "cookie": { "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "expiresAt": 1599999999999 }, "requestUrl": "https://h.edu/x", "nowMs": 1600000000000 },
      "expected": false
    },
    {
      "name": "expiring_exactly_now_not_sent",
      "input": { "cookie": { "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "expiresAt": 1600000000000 }, "requestUrl": "https://h.edu/x", "nowMs": 1600000000000 },
      "expected": false
    },
    {
      "name": "unexpired_sent",
      "input": { "cookie": { "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "expiresAt": 1600000000001 }, "requestUrl": "https://h.edu/x", "nowMs": 1600000000000 },
      "expected": true
    },
    {
      "name": "session_cookie_never_expires",
      "input": { "cookie": { "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "expiresAt": null }, "requestUrl": "https://h.edu/x", "nowMs": 8640000000000000 },
      "expected": true
    }
  ],
  "selectCookies": [
    {
      "name": "precedence_origin_over_ephemeral_same_name",
      "input": {
        "cookies": [
          { "name": "sid", "value": "FROM_ORIGIN", "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "source": "origin" },
          { "name": "sid", "value": "FROM_EPHEMERAL", "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "source": "ephemeral" }
        ],
        "requestUrl": "https://h.edu/"
      },
      "expected": [{ "name": "sid", "value": "FROM_ORIGIN" }]
    },
    {
      "name": "ephemeral_used_when_no_origin_same_name",
      "input": {
        "cookies": [{ "name": "client_id", "value": "E", "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "source": "ephemeral" }],
        "requestUrl": "https://h.edu/"
      },
      "expected": [{ "name": "client_id", "value": "E" }]
    },
    {
      "name": "coexist_different_names_sorted_by_name",
      "input": {
        "cookies": [
          { "name": "a", "value": "1", "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "source": "origin" },
          { "name": "b", "value": "2", "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "source": "ephemeral" }
        ],
        "requestUrl": "https://h.edu/"
      },
      "expected": [{ "name": "a", "value": "1" }, { "name": "b", "value": "2" }]
    },
    {
      "name": "nonmatching_dropped",
      "input": {
        "cookies": [
          { "name": "a", "value": "1", "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "source": "origin" },
          { "name": "x", "value": "9", "domain": "other.edu", "path": "/", "source": "origin" }
        ],
        "requestUrl": "https://h.edu/"
      },
      "expected": [{ "name": "a", "value": "1" }]
    },
    {
      "name": "host_only_dropped_for_subdomain",
      "input": {
        "cookies": [
          { "name": "host", "value": "H", "domain": "h.edu", "hostOnly": true, "path": "/", "source": "origin" },
          { "name": "domain", "value": "D", "domain": "h.edu", "hostOnly": false, "path": "/", "source": "origin" }
        ],
        "requestUrl": "https://sub.h.edu/"
      },
      "expected": [{ "name": "domain", "value": "D" }]
    },
    {
      "name": "longer_path_first",
      "input": {
        "cookies": [
          { "name": "p", "value": "root", "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "source": "origin" },
          { "name": "q", "value": "deep", "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/app/", "source": "origin" }
        ],
        "requestUrl": "https://h.edu/app/x"
      },
      "expected": [{ "name": "q", "value": "deep" }, { "name": "p", "value": "root" }]
    },

    {
      "name": "p1_05_same_name_different_path_both_sent_longer_first",
      "_doc": "P1-05 回归：`sid` 同时存在于 / 与 /api。浏览器两条都带、长 Path 在前。旧实现按 name 折叠，只剩一条（深路径会话被静默丢失）。",
      "input": {
        "cookies": [
          { "name": "sid", "value": "ROOT", "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "source": "origin" },
          { "name": "sid", "value": "API", "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/api", "source": "origin" }
        ],
        "requestUrl": "https://h.edu/api/grades",
        "nowMs": 1600000000000
      },
      "expected": [{ "name": "sid", "value": "API" }, { "name": "sid", "value": "ROOT" }]
    },
    {
      "name": "p1_05_same_name_only_matching_path_sent_outside",
      "_doc": "同名多 Path 时，路径不匹配的那条照常不发——并存不等于放宽 path-match。",
      "input": {
        "cookies": [
          { "name": "sid", "value": "ROOT", "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "source": "origin" },
          { "name": "sid", "value": "API", "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/api", "source": "origin" }
        ],
        "requestUrl": "https://h.edu/portal",
        "nowMs": 1600000000000
      },
      "expected": [{ "name": "sid", "value": "ROOT" }]
    },
    {
      "name": "p1_05_same_name_different_domain_both_sent",
      "_doc": "父域 + host-only 同名同 Path：域不同故互不覆盖，两条都发，tie-break 按 domain 升序。",
      "input": {
        "cookies": [
          { "name": "JSESSIONID", "value": "PARENT", "domain": "h.edu", "hostOnly": false, "path": "/", "source": "origin" },
          { "name": "JSESSIONID", "value": "HOST", "domain": "app.h.edu", "hostOnly": true, "path": "/", "source": "origin" }
        ],
        "requestUrl": "https://app.h.edu/x",
        "nowMs": 1600000000000
      },
      "expected": [{ "name": "JSESSIONID", "value": "HOST" }, { "name": "JSESSIONID", "value": "PARENT" }]
    },
    {
      "name": "gate2_ephemeral_suppressed_by_origin_same_name_other_path",
      "_doc": "栅栏 2 未被 P1-05 放宽：origin 有 `sid`（/api）时，ephemeral 的 `sid`（/）整条丢弃——adapter 不得借不同 Path 在同名会话旁「加塞」一条。",
      "input": {
        "cookies": [
          { "name": "sid", "value": "FROM_ORIGIN", "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/api", "source": "origin" },
          { "name": "sid", "value": "FROM_EPHEMERAL", "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "source": "ephemeral" }
        ],
        "requestUrl": "https://h.edu/api/x",
        "nowMs": 1600000000000
      },
      "expected": [{ "name": "sid", "value": "FROM_ORIGIN" }]
    },
    {
      "name": "gate2_ephemeral_kept_when_origin_same_name_does_not_match",
      "_doc": "压制只针对**本次请求实际命中**的 origin 同名条目；origin 的 `sid` 在 /admin 下不参与本请求，则 ephemeral 的 `sid` 仍可用。",
      "input": {
        "cookies": [
          { "name": "sid", "value": "FROM_ORIGIN", "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/admin", "source": "origin" },
          { "name": "sid", "value": "FROM_EPHEMERAL", "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "source": "ephemeral" }
        ],
        "requestUrl": "https://h.edu/public",
        "nowMs": 1600000000000
      },
      "expected": [{ "name": "sid", "value": "FROM_EPHEMERAL" }]
    },
    {
      "name": "p1_06_expired_cookie_not_selected",
      "input": {
        "cookies": [
          { "name": "live", "value": "1", "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "source": "origin", "expiresAt": 1600000000001 },
          { "name": "dead", "value": "2", "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "source": "origin", "expiresAt": 1599999999999 }
        ],
        "requestUrl": "https://h.edu/",
        "nowMs": 1600000000000
      },
      "expected": [{ "name": "live", "value": "1" }]
    },
    {
      "name": "p1_06_secure_cookie_not_selected_over_http",
      "input": {
        "cookies": [
          { "name": "sess", "value": "S", "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "source": "origin", "secure": true },
          { "name": "pref", "value": "P", "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "source": "origin", "secure": false }
        ],
        "requestUrl": "http://h.edu/",
        "nowMs": 1600000000000
      },
      "expected": [{ "name": "pref", "value": "P" }]
    },
    {
      "name": "p1_06_expired_origin_does_not_suppress_ephemeral",
      "_doc": "栅栏 2 的压制以「命中」为前提：已过期的 origin 同名条目不参与本请求，故不压制 ephemeral（也不会让请求带上死值）。",
      "input": {
        "cookies": [
          { "name": "t", "value": "DEAD_ORIGIN", "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "source": "origin", "expiresAt": 1599999999999 },
          { "name": "t", "value": "EPHEMERAL", "domain": "h.edu", "path": "/", "source": "ephemeral" }
        ],
        "requestUrl": "https://h.edu/",
        "nowMs": 1600000000000
      },
      "expected": [{ "name": "t", "value": "EPHEMERAL" }]
    }
  ],

  "parseCookieDate": [
